### 1. Cek Config (Publik)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/config

### 2. Login Admin (Jalankan ini dulu untuk dapat token)
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin@pnj.ac.id",
  "password": "KataSandi123"
}

### Simpan Token Admin otomatis dari response di atas
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.token}}

### 3. Cek Profil Admin (/auth/me)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 4. Ambil Semua Daftar Obat (/medicines)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/medicines
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5. Cek Dashboard Admin (/admin/dashboard)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. Daftar Mahasiswa Baru (/auth/register)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Anggi Komyati",
  "email": "anggi@mhsw.pnj.ac.id",
  "nim": "2507431013",
  "phone": "081234567890",
  "password": "Password123"
}

### 7. Login Mahasiswa
# @name loginMhs
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "anggi@mhsw.pnj.ac.id",
  "password": "Password123"
}

@mhsToken = {{loginMhs.response.body.data.token}}

### 8. Mahasiswa Ajukan Pengambilan Obat (Panadol id=1)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{mhsToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "medicine_id": 1,
  "type": "ambil",
  "qty": 1,
  "reason": "Sakit kepala saat praktikum",
  "pickup_date": "2026-11-26"
}

### 9. Mahasiswa Ajukan Donasi Obat
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/donations
Authorization: Bearer {{mhsToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "medicine_name": "Promag",
  "qty": 5,
  "expiry_date": "2027-08-01",
  "condition_type": "baru",
  "condition_desc": "Masih tersegel utuh dalam strip"
}

### 10. Admin Lihat Semua Transaksi Masuk
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 11. Admin Setujui Transaksi id=1
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/transactions/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "setujui",
  "admin_note": "Silakan ambil di sekretariat TIK"
}
